.DS_Store
# Claude Code orchestration (transient; produced by .claude/scripts/spawn-worker.sh)
.claude/orchestration-logs/
# Delivery-driver working state (transient; .claude/scripts/deliver-loop.sh):
# failure signatures, dismissed evidence ids, and the run report AS IT IS BEING
# WRITTEN. The finished report is NOT transient — at every stop the driver
# copies it to docs/runs/<timestamp>/run.md and opens a pull request carrying
# it. docs/runs/ is deliberately NOT ignored: a gitignored run log, in a web
# container that gets reclaimed, is exactly the defect that arrangement repairs.
.claude/deliver-loop/
# The review gate's evidence, as the runner leaves it. The workflow uploads this
# as an artifact and collect-evidence.sh lands it under docs/runs/; the local
# copy is scratch.
.claude/review-out/
# GitHub App credentials for the unattended driver's identity: the App ID and
# the PATH to its private key (.claude/scripts/app-token.sh reads it). Local to
# one machine and never committed — the .pem it points at must not be either.
.claude/app-identity
*.pem
# Worker worktrees live OUTSIDE .claude/, which Claude Code protects — a worker
# sandboxed under it is refused every write, silently. See spawn-worker.sh.
.worktrees/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
dist/
# The video index and transcript cache are local-only and never enter git
# (docs/DESIGN.md R21).
data/
